  "description": "Black cats are creatures of myths and folklore. On earth, superstition results in the mistreatment of black cats. A group of black cats imbued with powers bestowed upon them by the ascendant gods are sent into the mortal realm with missions of reshaping humanity's view of black cats. The success of their missions could mean an eternity in The Middle Ground as gods... that is... if they can stand by each other until the very end.",
